            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Necrotic Decay"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(divine, necromancy, negative)\n\nWhen an urdefhan dies, its invisible flesh quickly rots away and sublimates into a foul-smelling gas that fills a 5-foot emanation around the body. This gas deals 3d6 negative damage to creatures in this area as their flesh curdles and rots as well (17 basic Fortitude save)."
